{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found and close, take it and check properties, do specific task. Move and scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNear    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
